{"id": "10th-u9-q007", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "jayakanthan", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "quote_writing_purpose", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"நான் எழுதுவதற்கு ஒரு தூண்டுதலும் உண்டு; ஒரு காரணமும் உண்டு... என் எழுத்து மனிதனை உயர்த்தும் அறம் சார்ந்ததாக இருக்க வேண்டும்\" - என்று கூறியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "புதுமைப்பித்தன்", "B": "அண்ணா", "C": "ஜெயகாந்தன்", "D": "கல்கி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: தன் எழுத்துப் பணி சமுதாயத்தில் விளிம்புநிலை மனிதர்களின் குரலாகவும், மனிதப் பண்பை வளர்ப்பதாகவும் இருக்க வேண்டும் என ஜெயகாந்தன் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who asserted: \"I have an impetus and a purpose to write... my writing must elevate human conscience through moral strength\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pudhumaipithan", "B": "Anna", "C": "Jayakanthan", "D": "Kalki"}, "explanation": "Jayakanthan articulated this profound ethos behind his literary works."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 198, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th