{"id": "10th-u9-q098", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "quote_ki_ra_about_alagirisamy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"அழகிரிசாமியின் கதைகளில் மென்மையான சோகமும், மனிதர்கள் மீதான ஆழமான நம்பிக்கையும் ஒருசேர இழையோடும்\" - என்று பாராட்டியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கல்கி", "B": "கி. ராஜநாராயணன்", "C": "புதுமைப்பித்தன்", "D": "வ.ரா."}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: அழகிரிசாமியின் கலைத்தன்மை மற்றும் மென்மையான மனிதநேயத்தை கி. ராஜநாராயணன் பல கட்டுரைகளில் போற்றியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who praised Ku. Alagirisamy's storytelling as weaving gentle pathos with an indestructible faith in human goodness?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kalki", "B": "Ki. Rajanarayanan", "C": "Pudhumaipithan", "D": "Va. Ra."}, "explanation": "Ki. Rajanarayanan warmly attested to this aesthetic quality in his friend's works."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 207, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 207", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["கு. அழகிரிசாமி", "கி.ரா. பாராட்டு", "கதைச்சிறப்பு"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q099", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "story_setting_chennai_slum", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான்\" கதையின் களமாக அமையும் இடம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மதுரை கிராமம்", "B": "திருநெல்வேலி பாளையங்கோட்டை", "C": "சென்னையின் ஒரு பழைய சந்தில் அமைந்த ஏழை மக்களின் வாடகை வரிசை வீடுகள்", "D": "கோவில்பட்டி சந்தை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: சென்னை நகரின் நெரிசலான சந்தில் அமைந்துள்ள ஏழைக் குடியிருப்புப் பகுதியில் நோயுற்று வாடும் குப்புசாமியின் வாழ்விடமே கதைக் களம்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What serves as the atmospheric geographical backdrop for \"Oruvan Irukkiran\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "A Madurai village", "B": "Palayamkottai", "C": "An impoverished tenement row house in an old Chennai alley", "D": "Kovilpatti market"}, "explanation": "An impoverished tenement house in an old Chennai lane."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 206, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 206", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான்", "கதைக்களம்", "சென்னை சந்து"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q100", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_analysis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எழுத்தாளர் கு. அழகிரிசாமி பற்றிய பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இவர் கரிசல் இலக்கியத்தின் முன்னோடியாகக் கருதப்படுகிறார்.\n2. இவரது \"அன்பளிப்பு\" சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்பிற்கு சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது கிடைத்தது.\n3. இவர் மலேசியாவில் \"தமிழ் நேசன்\" இதழில் பணியாற்றினார்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும்", "D": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் ஆய்வு: கரிசல் முன்னோடி, அன்பளிப்பு சாகித்திய அகாதெமி, தமிழ் நேசன் ஆசிரியர் - மூன்றும் வரலாற்று உண்மைகள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze statements on Ku. Alagirisamy: 1. Pioneer of Karisal literature. 2. Won Sahitya Akademi for Anbalippu. 3. Edited Tamil Nesan in Malaysia. Which are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only", "B": "2 and 3 only", "C": "1 and 3 only", "D": "1, 2, and 3 - All are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements are historically verified."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 207, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 207", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["கு. அழகிரிசாமி", "கூற்று ஆய்வு", "அனைத்தும் சரி"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q101", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kuppusamy_dignity", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கதையில் குப்புசாமி நோயாளியாக இருந்தபோதிலும் எதனைத் தன் சுயமரியாதையாகக் கருதினான்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பிறரிடம் கையேந்தி யாசகம் கேட்காமல், எஞ்சியிருக்கும் தன் ஆற்றலால் வாழ நினைப்பது", "B": "பணக்காரர்களிடம் சண்டையிடுவது", "C": "மருத்துவரை ஏமாற்றுவது", "D": "வீட்டைப் பூட்டிக்கொள்வது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கம்: கொடிய வறுமையிலும் தன்மானத்தோடு வாழ்ந்து, தனக்குக் கிடைத்த சொற்ப உணவிலும் பிற உயிர்களுக்குப் பகிர்ந்து தரும் உயரிய பண்பு அவனிடம் மிளிர்ந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Despite his dire illness, what formed Kuppusamy's unwavering sense of personal self-respect?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Refusing to beg and preserving moral dignity while sharing whatever little he had", "B": "Fighting with the wealthy", "C": "Cheating doctors", "D": "Locking himself away"}, "explanation": "Preserving human dignity without begging and sharing meager food."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "1