{"id": "10th-u9-q129", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "anigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_analysis_anigal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அணிகள் பற்றிய கீழ்க்காணும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. தற்குறிப்பேற்ற அணியில் இயற்கையான நிகழ்வின் மீது கவிஞன் தன் கருத்தை ஏற்றுவான்.\n2. தீவகம் என்றால் விளக்கு என்பது பொருள்.\n3. நிரல்நிறை அணியில் சொற்கள் தாறுமாறாக நிறுத்தப்படும்.\nஇவற்றுள் தவறான கூற்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "3 மட்டும் (தவறு: சொற்களும் பொருள்களும் வரிசையாக நிறுத்தப்படும்)", "B": "1 மட்டும்", "C": "2 மட்டும்", "D": "1 மற்றும் 2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் ஆய்வு: நிரல்நிறை அணியில் சொல்லும் பொருளும் முறை மாறாமல் வரிசையாக நிறுத்தப்படும். கூற்று 3-இல் தாறுமாறாக எனக் கூறியிருப்பதால் அது தவறு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze statements on figures: 1. Tharkurippetram attributes poet's intent. 2. Theevagam means lamp. 3. Niralnirai scatters words randomly. Which is incorrect?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "3 only (False: words are placed in strict sequential order)", "B": "1 only", "C": "2 only", "D": "1 and 2"}, "explanation": "Statement 3 is false as Niralnirai arranges words strictly in orderly parallel rows."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 208, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 208", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["அணிகள்", "கூற்று ஆய்வு", "தவறான கூற்று"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q130", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "anigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_tharkurippetram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா] \"போருழந் தெடுத்த ஆரெயில் நெடுங்கொடி வாரல் என்பனபோல் மறித்துக் கைகாட்ட\" - இதில் வரும் \"வாரல்\" என்பதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வாருங்கள்", "B": "வராதீர்கள் (வாராதே எனத் தடுத்தல்)", "C": "செல்லுங்கள்", "D": "நில்லுங்கள்"}, "explanation": "TNPSC வினா ஆய்வு: \"வாரல்\" என்பது எதிர்மறைப் பொருள் தந்து \"இங்கு வராதீர்கள்\" எனத் தடுத்துக் கைகாட்டியதைக் குறிக்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In \"Vaaral enbanapol maritthu kai kaatta\", what does \"Vaaral\" mean?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Please come", "B": "Do not come (prohibiting/warning away)", "C": "Go away", "D": "Wait here"}, "explanation": "Vaaral is a negative command meaning \"Do not enter\"."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 208, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 208", "url": null, "source_n