{"id": "10th-u9-q141", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ozhukkam_vizhuppam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஒழுக்கம் விழுப்பம் தரலான் ஒழுக்கம் / உயிரினும் ஓம்பப் படும்\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் வள்ளுவர் எதனை உயிரை விட மேலானதாகக் காக்க வேண்டும் என்கிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஒழுக்கத்தை", "B": "செல்வத்தை", "C": "கல்வியை", "D": "புகழை"}, "explanation": "திருக்குறள் (அதிகாரம்: ஒழுக்கமுடைமை): ஒழுக்கம் ஒருவருக்கு அனைத்து மேன்மைகளையும் தரும் என்பதால், அதனைத் தன் உயிரை விடச் சிறந்ததாகப் போற்றிக் காக்க வேண்டும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Ozhukkam vizhuppam tharalaan...\", what does Valluvar mandate must be guarded more precious than life itself?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Moral conduct / Character (Ozhukkam)", "B": "Wealth", "C": "Learning", "D": "Fame"}, "explanation": "Righteous moral conduct must be guarded dearer than life."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 70, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 70", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["திருக்குறள்", "ஒழுக்கமுடைமை", "உயிரினும் ஓம்பப்படும்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q142", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "meyyunarthal_epporul", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"எப்பொருள் எத்தன்மைத் தாயினும் அப்பொருள் / மெய்ப்பொருள் காண்ப தறிவு\" - இக்குறள் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள அதிகாரம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அறிவுடைமை", "B": "மெய்யுணர்தல்", "C": "வாய்மை", "D": "தெரிந்து செயல்வகை"}, "explanation": "திருக்குறள் (அதிகாரம்: மெய்யுணர்தல்): எந்தப் பொருள் எத்தன்மையான வடிவில் தோன்றினாலும், அதன் உள்ளிருக்கும் உண்மைப் பொருளை ஆராய்ந்து அறிவதே உண்மையான அறிவு ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "From which chapter is the celebrated Kural \"Epporul eththanmaith thaayinum apporul meipporul kaanpathu arivu\" taken?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Arivudaimai", "B": "Meiyunarthal (Realization of Truth)", "C": "Vaaimai", "D": "Therinthu Seyalvagai"}, "explanation": "It is from the chapter Meiyunarthal."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 71, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 71", "url": null, "