{"id": "10th-u9-q143", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyaraith_thunaikkodal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"பல்லார் பகைகொளலின் பத்தடுத்த தீமைத்தே / நல்லார் தொடர்கை விடல்\" - இக்குறட்பா உணர்த்தும் முதன்மை அறம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பலருடன் பகைமை கொள்ள வேண்டும்", "B": "பகைவரை எளிதில் வெல்லலாம்", "C": "பலரோடு பகைத்துக் கொள்வதை விடவும், பெரியோரின் நற்பண்புகளுடைய நட்பைக் கைவிடுவது பத்து மடங்கு கொடிய தீமையைத் தரும்", "D": "தனியாக வாழ்வது சிறந்தது"}, "explanation": "திருக்குறள் (அதிகாரம்: பெரியாரைத் துணைக்கோடல்): பலருடைய பகையைத் தேடிக்கொள்வதை விட, பெரியோர்களது நட்பை விட்டுவிடுவது பல மடங்கு பெரும் அழிவைத் தரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What moral imperative is stressed in \"Pallaar pagaikolalin paththadutha theemaithae nallaar thodargai vidal\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Enmity with many is desirable", "B": "Foes are easy to defeat", "C": "Abandoning the fellowship of the virtuous is ten times worse than earning the enmity of many", "D": "Solitary living is best"}, "explanation": "Losing friendship of the wise is ten times more ruinous than facing multiple enemies."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 71, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 71", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["திருக்குறள்", "பெரியாரைத் துணைக்கோடல்", "நல்லார் தொடர்கைவிடல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q144", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kodungonmai_paingoozh", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"கொலையிற் கொடியாரை வேந்தொறுத்தல் பைங்கூழ் / களைகட் டதனோடு நேர்\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் அரசன் கொடியவர்களைத் தண்டிப்பது எதற்கு ஒப்பாகக் கூறப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மரங்களை வெட்டுவதற்கு", "B": "மண்ணைத் தோண்டுவதற்கு", "C": "நீரைப் பாய்ச்சுவதற்கு", "D": "பயிர்களுக்கு இடையே வளரும் நச்சுப் புல்/களைகளைப் பறித்து எறிவதற்கு (களைகட்டுதல்)"}, "explanation": "திருக்குறள் (அதிகாரம்: கொடுங்கோன்மை): கொடிய குற்றவாளிகளை அரசன் தண்டிப்பது, நற்பயிரைக் காக்க உழவன் களைகளைப் பிடுங்கி எறிவதைப் போன்ற இன்றியமையாத அரச கடமையாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kural comparing punishment of wicked criminals, to what agricultural act is a ruler's justice likened?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Felling trees", "B": "Digging soil", "C": "Channeling water", "D": "Weeding out unwanted noxious tares/weeds from tender green crops (Kalaikattudhal)"}, "explanation": "Punishing violent offenders is likened to weeding noxious tares to save crops."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 142, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 142", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["திருக்குறள்", "கொடுங்கோன்மை", "களைகட்டுதல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q145", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kannoattam_definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"பண்ணென்னாம் பாடற் கியைபின்றேல் கண்ணென்னாம் / கண்ணோட்டம் இல்லாத கண்\" - இதில் \"கண்ணோட்டம்\" என்பதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இரக்கம் / கருணை (மனிதாபிமானம்)", "B": "கண்களின் பார்வைத் திறன்", "C": "வேகமாகப் பார்த்தல்", "D": "கண்களின் அழகு"}, "explanation": "திருக்குறள் (அதிகாரம்: கண்ணோட்டம்): பாடலோடு பொருந்தாத இசை வீணாவது போல, இரக்கமும் கருணையுமற்ற பார்வை மனிதக் கண்ணாக இருப்பதில் பயனில்லை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Pannennaam paadarku iyaibintrel kannennaam kannoattam illatha kann\", what does \"Kannoattam\" mean?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Compassionate grace / Empathy / Kindness", "B": "Physical eyesight acuity", "C": "Rapid glance", "D": "Beauty of eyes"}, "explanation": "Kannoattam denotes compassionate grace and empathy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 142, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10