{"id": "10th-u9-q165", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "unit9_overall", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "unit9_theme_summary", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "10-ஆம் வகுப்பு இயல் 9 \"அன்பின் மொழி\" உணர்த்தும் முதன்மைப் பொதுக்கருத்து யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மனிதநேயம், பிறருக்காக வாழும் தியாகம் மற்றும் உலகளாவிய சகோதரத்துவம்", "B": "போரிட்டு வெல்லுதல்", "C": "பொருளீட்டுதல் மட்டுமே", "D": "இயற்கையை அழித்தல்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பொதுக்கருத்து: ஜெயகாந்தன், நாகூர் ரூமி, வீரமாமுனிவர், கு. அழகிரிசாமி மற்றும் திருவள்ளுவர் ஆகியோரின் படைப்புகள் வழியே மானுடப் பேரன்பே இங்கு நிலைநிறுத்தப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the overarching ethical synthesis of Standard 10 Unit 9 \"Anbin Mozhi\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Humanitarianism, sacrificial living for others, and universal compassion", "B": "Martial conquest", "C": "Material greed", "D": "Destroying nature"}, "explanation": "Universal humanitarian empathy and living altruistically for others."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 212, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 212", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["இயல் 9 தொகுப்பு", "மையப்பொருள்", "அன்பின் மொழி"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q166", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "unit9_overall", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "authors_timeline_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இயல் 9 படைப்பாளர்களையும் அவர்களது இலக்கிய வகைகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nஅ) ஜெயகாந்தன் - 1. தேம்பாவணி கிறித்தவக் காப்பியம்\nஆ) நாகூர் ரூமி - 2. ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான் சிறுகதை\nஇ) வீரமாமுனிவர் - 3. சித்தாளு புதுக்கவிதை\nஈ) கு. அழகிரிசாமி - 4. நினைவுச் சிறப்பிதழ் உரைநடை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-1, ஈ-2", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: ஜெயகாந்தன் - உரைநடை; நாகூர் ரூமி - சித்தாளு; வீரமாமுனிவர் - தேம்பாவணி; கு. அழகிரிசாமி - ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match Unit 9 authors with their literary forms: a) Jayakanthan - 1. Thembavani epic b) Nagoor Rumi - 2. Oruvan Irukkiran story c) Veeramamunivar - 3. Siddhaalu poem d) Ku. Alagirisamy - 4. Prose monograph.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "Correct match is a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 212, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 212", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["பொருத்துக", "இயல் 9 படைப்பாளர்கள்", "இலக்கிய வகை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q167", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "unit9_overall", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_iyal9_vocab", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்கண்டவற்றுள் சரியான இணையைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்க:\n1. Humanism - மனிதநேயம்\n2. Cultural Boundary - பண்பாட்டு எல்லை\n3. Cabin - சிற்றறை\nஇவற்றுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "C": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய மூன்றும் சரியானவை", "D": "1 மட்டும்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் கலைச்சொல் ஆய்வு: மூன்று கலைச்சொற்களும் பாடநூலில் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ள சரியான மொழியாக்கங்கள் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify correct vocabulary correspondences: 1. Humanism - Manidhaneyam 2. Cultural Boundary - Panbaattu Ellai 3. Cabin - Sitrarai.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only", "B": "2 and 3 only", "C": "1, 2, and 3 - All three are correct", "D": "1 only"}, "explanation": "All three vocabulary pairs are accurate textbook translations."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 212, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference":